UPDATE companies SET description='Maney Wire & Cable was established on March 1, 1986, in Santa Fe Springs, California, as a wholesale distributor of electrical wire and cable. The company began by responding to customer needs and quickly expanded into a full-line wholesale distributor carrying a complete line of electrical products.

Today the company maintains an inventory of over 7,000 line items, with millions of feet of cable stocked across nine distribution centers. It supplies electrical wire, cable, accessories, and related products to the electrical, automotive, and marine markets. Value-added services include custom wire printing, stripping, bonded parallel cable assemblies, custom battery cables, and cut heat-shrink pieces.

Maney Wire & Cable serves the electrical, automotive, and marine industries, as well as the entertainment stage lighting sector.

The company distinguishes itself through a focus on domestic-made products, competitive pricing, and rapid fulfillment from its multi-location network. Its 2023 integration into the AZ Wire & Cable family further expanded its resources and service capabilities.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire printing", "Wire stripping", "Bonded parallel custom cable", "Custom battery cable assembly", "Cut heat shrink pieces"], "industries": ["Electrical", "Automotive", "Marine", "Entertainment stage lighting"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 7,000 stocked line items", "Nine distribution centers across the U.S., Mexico, and Canada", "Wire printing and stripping services", "Custom bonded parallel cable and battery cable assemblies", "Predominantly USA-made product inventory"], "facts_used": ["Founded March 1, 1986 -> /about", "Headquarters Santa Fe Springs, CA -> db", "Over 7,000 stocking items -> /about", "Nine distribution locations -> /about", "Serves US, Mexico, Canada -> /about", "Value-added services: wire printing, stripping, custom cable -> /services", "Industries: electrical, automotive, marine -> /about", "Entertainment stage lighting -> industries_served", "Joined AZ Wire & Cable family in 2023 -> /about", "Stocks USA-made products -> /about", "Competitive price, superior quality, fast friendly service -> /about"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "unclear", "type_evidence": "wholesale electrical wire and cable distributor", "founded_year": "1986", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='maney-wire-cable-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Manufacture Nevada operates from Reno, Nevada As the official representative of the MEP National Network in the state, it functions as a publicly funded manufacturing extension partnership. The center receives funding from grants and public partners to subsidize consulting and training services for Nevada manufacturers.

The organization provides three core service lines: Business Growth consulting to help manufacturers navigate challenges and identify opportunities; Workforce Solutions including leadership workshops, cross-training programs, and manager skills development; and Manufacturing Operations consulting focused on process improvement, productivity, and profitability. It also delivers specialized training such as Lean Six Sigma Black Belt, PCQI 2.0 for food safety, and leadership workshops across Northern and Southern Nevada.

Manufacture Nevada serves manufacturers across Nevada, connecting them with resources, partners, and funding. Documented client engagements include EIS Automation, which secured $2 million in growth capital; Pilula; K2 Energy Solutions; and Alpha Productions Technologies. The center''s network spans businesses, organizations, and resources throughout Nevada and the U.S.

The center''s funding model distinguishes it from private consultants: public funding allows more affordable access to expert advisors, and its success is measured solely by client outcomes. As an MEP National Network representative, it provides access to opportunities available only through publicly funded programs.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Business growth consulting", "Workforce development and training", "Manufacturing operations consulting", "Lean Six Sigma Black Belt training", "PCQI 2.0 preventive controls training", "Leadership workshops", "Partner network facilitation", "Grant funding navigation", "Process improvement consulting", "Productivity and profitability analysis"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Public funding model reduces cost of expert consulting and training", "Official MEP National Network representative for Nevada", "Success measured by client business outcomes", "Connects manufacturers to partners, resources, and grant opportunities", "Offers subsidized workshops including Lean Six Sigma and PCQI certification"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters at 450 Sinclair St., Reno, NV 89501 -> /", "Official representative of MEP National Network in Nevada -> /about", "Provides Business Growth, Workforce Solutions, Manufacturing Operations consulting -> /", "Funded by grants and public partners to subsidize services -> /", "Offers Lean Six Sigma Black Belt, PCQI 2.0, and leadership workshops -> /", "Client success stories: EIS Automation, Pilula, K2 Energy Solutions, Alpha Productions Technologies -> /", "ISO9001 certification -> db", "Phone  -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Manufacture Nevada is the official representative of the MEP National Network\u2122 in Nevada. The MEP National Network is a unique public-private partnership that delivers comprehensive, proven solutions to U.S. manufacturers, fueling growth and advancing U.S. manufacturing.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='manufacture-nevada' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Manufacturing Technologies, Inc. (MTI) operates from a 23,000-square-foot facility in Bernalillo, New Mexico, just north of Albuquerque. The company traces its roots to 1989, when it began as a small manual machine shop in Albuquerque. Over the decades it has evolved into a contract precision manufacturer offering both CNC machining and fabrication under one roof. The business is led by President Lucas Bulow.

MTI provides CNC machining and precision fabrication services in-house. Its machining capabilities include 5-axis milling, 3-axis turning, and wire EDM, with the ability to hold tolerances tighter than 0.0005 inch. The fabrication side covers CNC laser cutting, press brake forming, and MIG and TIG welding; the laser system can maintain ±0.005 inch on profiles from 0.001 to 0.375 inch thick. The company works with a wide range of metals — including hardened steel, stainless, titanium, tungsten, rhenium, nickel-based alloys, copper, brass, tantalum, and aluminum — as well as plastics. Operations run out of a 23,000-plus-square-foot plant.

The shop serves aerospace, defense, fluid-handling, oil-and-gas, and transportation sectors, supplying both private-sector and government customers. Its AS9100D/ISO 9001:2015 certification and ITAR registration enable it to handle defense and aerospace work that requires controlled documentation and export compliance.

MTI emphasizes its willingness to tackle complex, challenging parts while maintaining quality and on-time delivery. The company describes its model as selling flexibility — accepting any material, quantity, or complexity — and backs that with lean manufacturing techniques, advanced software, and high-end tooling to keep pricing competitive.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100D','ISO 9001:2015','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["5-axis milling", "3-axis turning", "wire EDM", "CNC laser cutting", "press brake forming", "MIG welding", "TIG welding", "heat treating (outsourced)", "plating (anodize, nickel, chemical film)", "silk screening", "powder coating"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Fluid handling", "Oil and gas", "Transportation"], "materials": ["Hardened Steel", "Stainless Steel", "Structural Steel", "Carbon Steel", "Titanium", "Tungsten", "Rhenium", "Aluminum", "Nickel-Based Alloys", "Copper", "Brass", "Tantalum", "Plastics"], "equipment": ["5-axis milling machines", "3-axis turning centers", "wire EDM machines", "CNC laser cutting systems", "press brakes", "MIG/TIG welding equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "Machining: <0.0005 in; Laser cutting: \u00b10.005 in on 0.001\u20130.375 in thick material", "built_on": ["Takes on complex, challenging parts without sacrificing quality or delivery", "Offers flexibility across any material, quantity, or complexity", "Uses lean manufacturing, advanced software, and high-end tooling for competitive pricing", "In-house CNC machining and precision fabrication under one roof", "AS9100D/ISO 9001:2015 certified and ITAR registered"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1989 as manual machine shop in Albuquerque -> /about", "Expanded to 23,000+ sq ft facility in Bernalillo, NM in 2017 -> /about", "President Lucas Bulow -> /about", "AS9100D/ISO 9001:2015 certified and ITAR registered -> /about", "Industries: aerospace, defense, fluids, oil and gas, transportation -> /, /about", "Capabilities: CNC machining, 5-axis milling, 3-axis turning, wire EDM, precision fabrication, CNC laser cutting, press brake forming, MIG/TIG welding -> /services", "Materials: Hardened Steel, Stainless Steel, Structural Steel, Carbon Steel, Titanium, Tungsten, Rhenium, Aluminum, Nickel-Based Alloys, Copper, Brass, Tantalum, Plastics -> /services", "Tolerances: machining <0.0005 in, laser cutting \u00b10.005 in on 0.001\u20130.375 in -> /services", "Lean manufacturing, advanced software, high-end tooling for competitive pricing -> /, /about", "Flexibility: any material, any quantity, any complexity -> /, /services", "External finishing services (heat treating, plating, silk screening, powder coating) -> /about", "Mission: highest quality precision parts with on-time delivery -> /about", "NTMA New Mexico Chapter membership -> /about", "Headquarters city/state from database -> db"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Manufacturing Technologies Incorporated (MTI) is a diverse contract job shop that provides high quality CNC machined and precision fabricated parts proudly manufactured in the USA", "founded_year": "1989", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["ITAR registered"], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='manufacturing-technologies-inc-mti' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Maple Lane Variety Fab operates a full-service welding and fabrication shop in Kawkawlin, Michigan, serving the greater Bay City and Tri-Cities region. The company provides custom metal fabrication, welding, and inspection services for both residential and commercial customers.

It also maintains an inspection department staffed by American Welding Society Certified Welding Inspectors who perform dry magnetic particle, dye penetrant, structural steel, RCSC bolting, pan decking, shear stud, and dry film thickness examinations, and who can qualify welders and procedures to AWS D1.1.

Customers span agricultural, industrial, and structural steel sectors, with typical work covering ornamental and safety railings, metal signage, indoor and outdoor furniture, structural frameworks, and repair of farm and heavy equipment. The company offers mobile welding and repair crews that travel throughout the Tri-Cities area.

