ncoming inspection -> /quality", "Manufacturing facility designed for production innovation and quality standards -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our manufacturing facility is specifically designed to provide the best possible production, promote innovation and maintain inflexible quality standards. Marlex is the quality leader in pharmaceutical distribution.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='marlex-pharmaceuticals-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
